|--------------|
| brand |

### Impact Contracts

```yaml
impact_contracts:
  - object_type_id: brand
    expected_operation: add
    description: 创建品牌并填写名称、英文名、国家、官网及状态。
    affected_fields:
      - brand_name
      - brand_name_en
      - country
      - website
      - status
```


